    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you aren't wearing Medium or Heavy armor, you gain a bonus to your AC equal to your Charisma modifier (minimum of +1).</p><p>You also gain proficiency in one of the following skills of your choice: Acrobatics, Intimidation, Performance, or Persuasion.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-s4nuPJU41dXOSIll\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature includes an Active Effect for the AC bonus which is disabled by default.  When you are not wearing Medium or Heavy armor you may enable this effect to receive the AC bonus.</p></section>",
